'''Las Serras''' ({{Literal translation|the mountains}}) is one of ten [[Regions of Balisca|regions]] of [[Hesperia]], within the [[Baliscan Confederation]]. It is bordered by [[Acacias]] to the north, [[Guarapiranga]] to the south, [[Llaragón]] to the west, and the [[W:Atlantic Ocean|South Atlantic Ocean]] to the east. It has an area of {{convert|48,506|km2|abbr=on}} making it the [[List of Baliscan regions by area|11th-largest]] region of Balisca. It had a population of 1,988,095 in the [[2025 Baliscan census]]. The capital and largest city of Las Serras is [[Bona Aria]]. 

